{"id":"f748d191ce42f6ef","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-open-provability-formula.md","title":"Provability of Numeral Instances","display":"df-open-provability-formula — Provability of Numeral Instances","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-open-provability-formula","aliases":["89-df-open-provability-formula"],"display":"df-open-provability-formula — Provability of Numeral Instances","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-open-provability-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-open-provability-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-open-provability-formula — Provability of Numeral Instances"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(v_{i_0},\\ldots,v_{i_{k-1}})\">\\(\\vec x=(v_{i_0},\\ldots,v_{i_{k-1}})\\)</span> 按严格递增指标列出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 可为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>同时替换取本书一阶语法操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 及图公式的绑定变元按最小可用指标改名，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{p_f}\">\\(G_{p_f}\\)</span> 按本书原始递归图表示及内部定义方程选择固定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是同一编码下的 PA 证明公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的数值函数表示沿用同一固定表示环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr E\">\\(\\mathscr E\\)</span>：对下式实际出现的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_f\">\\(p_f\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的元数、有限定义子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_f\">\\(\\mathcal E_f\\)</span>、先行辅助图环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_f\">\\(\\eta_f\\)</span> 均为已显示数值定义的展开数据，并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Adm}(f)\">\\(\\mathsf{Adm}(f)\\)</span>。这些数据不得在同一公式的不同位置更换；特别是关系名使用其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0/1\">\\(0/1\\)</span> 特征函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Adm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Adm}\\)</span>、子句满足关系与最小证书选择均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}provability\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ng_\\varphi&amp;:\\omega^k\\to\\omega,\\qquad\ng_\\varphi(\\vec n)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\vec x:=\\overline{\\vec n}]\\urcorner,\\\\\nG_\\varphi(\\vec x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq G_{p_{g_\\varphi}}(\\vec x,y)\\land\\bigwedge_{j&lt;k}(x_j=x_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists y\\,(G_\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi])&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\ G_\\varphi(\\vec x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}provability\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ng_\\varphi&amp;:\\omega^k\\to\\omega,\\qquad\ng_\\varphi(\\vec n)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\vec x:=\\overline{\\vec n}]\\urcorner,\\\\\nG_\\varphi(\\vec x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq G_{p_{g_\\varphi}}(\\vec x,y)\\land\\bigwedge_{j&lt;k}(x_j=x_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists y\\,(G_\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi])&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\ G_\\varphi(\\vec x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\mathsf{FreeList}(\\varphi),\\quad k=|\\mathsf{FreeList}(\\varphi)|,\\quad y=\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\varphi),1)_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vec x=\\mathsf{FreeList}(\\varphi),\\quad k=|\\mathsf{FreeList}(\\varphi)|,\\quad y=\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\varphi),1)_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 45–46；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 219–220；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span>，它等价于通常 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;0\">\\(k&gt;0\\)</span>，表示每个数值赋值下对应数词实例的可证性，不是把开放 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的恒定语法码直接代入 Prov。编码操作取可证明总的标准图表示，确保保留显示参数并允许量词与盒交错。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的数值函数表示沿用同一固定表示环境 $\\mathscr E$：对下式实际出现的每个 $p_f$，$f$ 的元数、有限定义子句 $\\mathcal E_f$、先行辅助图环境 $\\eta_f$ 均为已显示数值定义的展开数据，并满足 $\\mathsf{Adm}(f)$。这些数据不得在同一公式的不同位置更换；特别是关系名使用其 $0/1$ 特征函数。$\\mathsf{Adm}$、子句满足关系与最小证书选择均取 [[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(v_{i_0},\\ldots,v_{i_{k-1}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"G_{p_f}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr E","display":false},{"tex":"p_f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Adm}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"0/1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Adm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}provability\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ng_\\varphi&:\\omega^k\\to\\omega,\\qquad\ng_\\varphi(\\vec n)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\vec x:=\\overline{\\vec n}]\\urcorner,\\\\\nG_\\varphi(\\vec x,y)&\\coloneqq G_{p_{g_\\varphi}}(\\vec x,y)\\land\\bigwedge_{j<k}(x_j=x_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\vec x)&\\coloneqq\n\\exists y\\,(G_\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi])&=\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\ G_\\varphi(\\vec x,y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\vec x=\\mathsf{FreeList}(\\varphi),\\quad k=|\\mathsf{FreeList}(\\varphi)|,\\quad y=\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\varphi),1)_0.","display":true},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"k>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2832,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee07d81809d7603